997683779"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-08-19T09:19:17.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2090005671492329903"],"id":"2090005671492329903","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":5612,"like_count":28,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":11,"retweet_count":1},"text":"被UFO录取了 要去别的星球生活了 求祝福","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2090005671492329903"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-08-18T18:48:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2089786527459234195"],"id":"2089786527459234195","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":3233,"like_count":47,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":28,"retweet_count":0},"text":"沉迷于短暂的浪漫关系会让我丧失爱人的能力吗？\n我觉得并不会的。\n爱人是一项长期习得的技能，我知道对方会想要什么，也知道自己能够给予什么。\n绕来绕去的真心，欲拒还迎的言语，想要抛诸脑后，抛诸脑后，只剩下身体的温度，紧贴的心跳。\n当我处于自洽的生活状态时，我只需要睡个好觉。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2089786527459234195"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-08-18T17:42:39.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2089769960491155636"],"id":"2089769960491155636","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2313,"like_count":16,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"被投喂之 https://t.co/Y3rpC9dt3c","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2089769960491155636"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-08-18T17:30:57.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2089767018283364554"],"id":"2089767018283364554","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1815,"like_count":19,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"text":"感谢伤害 感谢离开 感谢音乐 感谢爱 感谢中国禁枪","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2089767018283364554"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-08-18T17:25:49.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2089765723111625110"],"id":"2089765723111625110","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":3488,"like_count":62,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":10},"text":"关于你，我还能再写些什么呢？\n写言不由衷、写悔不当初、写痛不欲生、写你那实在令人费解的真心、写依依不舍时那落下的快将我焚烧的眼泪，还是写这一场我无论如何都走不出来的冬天。\n一直到如今，我都还没有用尽世界上最浓重的修辞来写你，却已无力再为你写信。\n长忆长苦，常痛常新。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2089765723111625110"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-08-18T17:24:55.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2089765497965564083"],"id":"2089765497965564083","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1845,"like_count":13,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":1},"text":"爱让我好痛苦","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2089765497965564083"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-08-17T13:09:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2089338884731920721"],"id":"2089338884731920721","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":2905,"like_count":46,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":4},"text":"这世上不是所有人都有当断则断及时止损的能力。耗尽精力的活该和问心无愧也是一种选择。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2089338884731920721"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-08-17T13:07:15.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2089338265107308881"],"id":"2089338265107308881","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":2784,"like_count":42,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":2},"text":"在重大感情的决定上面我不接受任何的方法论。\n如果我还舍不得，我还想要给机会，那我就会一直给。\n如果我觉得我想要放弃了，那就已经结束了，自然也就不会有机会。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2089338265107308881"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-08-17T13:01:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2089336745758482648"],"id":"2089336745758482648","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1887,"like_count":17,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":2},"text":"其实 人们很少去做他们相信是对的事 他们会做比较方便的事 然后后悔","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2089336745758482648"}],"includes":{"tweets":[{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-08-19T09:19:17.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2090005671492329903"],"id":"2090005671492329903","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":5612,"like_count":28,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":11,"retweet_count":1},"text":"被UFO录取了 要去别的星球生活了 求祝福"}],"users":[{"id":"19